From: SaaiOS <os@saaios>
Subject: synaptics td4150: REPORT_STATUS 0x1b copies fw_status and downloads config

since18 discarded leftover REPORT_STATUS (0x1b payload 10 00) and then
SPI-read while ATTN was already low, desyncing the bus. 10 00 is the HDL
status frame: invalid=0 need_disp=0 need_app=0 hdl_version=2 osh=0.
Stock zeroflash_syncbox copies fw_status and calls
zeroflash_download_config() (CMD 0x30 APP_CONFIG), not ENABLE_REPORT 0x05
and not another ROMBOOT 0x45.

since19:
- Fully-read 0x1b (IRQ or drain): copy fw_status + download_config.
  Minimal zeroflash_hcd if skip-HDL never inited; never retry 0x45 when
  already mode 0x02; do not set in_hdl_mode.
- Drain stops immediately if ATTN is deasserted (same polarity as
  attn=1 then 0 after the first good read). Never idle-bus SPI read.
- If touch_init already ok, skip identify+touch_reinit (log skip). A
  reinit timeout does not unwind IRQ.
- No do_polling. No ENABLE_REPORT 0x05 as enable path.

Applies after syna-tcm-onchip-clear-hdl-reinit.patch.

